    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OVR Locomotion Effect is an overlay tool that aims to reduce VR (motion) sickness. It displays comfortable effect to HMD with thumb-stick input. You can use the effect to all SteamVR games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>We recommend trying the demo first before making your purchase.</strong> It is a fully featured, but time-limited for each try. It should be compatible with any VR game in your library. See if it helps reduce VR sickness for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Anti-VR sickness effect with thumb-stick inputs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/3f0b516797efe30f88181e1017f38c27.poster.avif?t=1754582181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/3f0b516797efe30f88181e1017f38c27.webm?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/3f0b516797efe30f88181e1017f38c27.mp4?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Displays VR-sickness reducing effect on the HMD based on your control inputs. After initial setup, the effect may be applied to any SteamVR game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dashboard settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/c0d140b00c055eb3597db14efc4c9839.poster.avif?t=1754582181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/c0d140b00c055eb3597db14efc4c9839.webm?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/c0d140b00c055eb3597db14efc4c9839.mp4?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Quickly adjust effects on the SteamVR dashboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/6cf3421c35519ad2f8401fbcc9093870.poster.avif?t=1754582181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/6cf3421c35519ad2f8401fbcc9093870.webm?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/6cf3421c35519ad2f8401fbcc9093870.mp4?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>There are vignette, room, point and wind effects. These effects can be combined use. You can adjust it to be barely visible or cover a large portion of the field of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gamepad</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/7c2b4ce69f402f25da0fd655c9d333ca.poster.avif?t=1754582181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/7c2b4ce69f402f25da0fd655c9d333ca.webm?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/7c2b4ce69f402f25da0fd655c9d333ca.mp4?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Gamepad supported. Get rid of the sickness from your VR mods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">User guide, FAQ,\u00a0Bug reports and requests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please check the forum (discussion) page from right menu of this page. You can get support from the forum or discord server.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OVR Locomotion Effect is an overlay tool that aims to reduce VR (motion) sickness. It displays comfortable effect to HMD with thumb-stick input. You can use the effect to all SteamVR games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>We recommend trying the demo first before making your purchase.</strong> It is a fully featured, but time-limited for each try. It should be compatible with any VR game in your library. See if it helps reduce VR sickness for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Anti-VR sickness effect with thumb-stick inputs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/3f0b516797efe30f88181e1017f38c27.poster.avif?t=1754582181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/3f0b516797efe30f88181e1017f38c27.webm?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/3f0b516797efe30f88181e1017f38c27.mp4?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Displays VR-sickness reducing effect on the HMD based on your control inputs. After initial setup, the effect may be applied to any SteamVR game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dashboard settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/c0d140b00c055eb3597db14efc4c9839.poster.avif?t=1754582181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/c0d140b00c055eb3597db14efc4c9839.webm?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/c0d140b00c055eb3597db14efc4c9839.mp4?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Quickly adjust effects on the SteamVR dashboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/6cf3421c35519ad2f8401fbcc9093870.poster.avif?t=1754582181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/6cf3421c35519ad2f8401fbcc9093870.webm?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/6cf3421c35519ad2f8401fbcc9093870.mp4?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>There are vignette, room, point and wind effects. These effects can be combined use. You can adjust it to be barely visible or cover a large portion of the field of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gamepad</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/7c2b4ce69f402f25da0fd655c9d333ca.poster.avif?t=1754582181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/7c2b4ce69f402f25da0fd655c9d333ca.webm?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393780/extras/7c2b4ce69f402f25da0fd655c9d333ca.mp4?t=1754582181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Gamepad supported. Get rid of the sickness from your VR mods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">User guide, FAQ,\u00a0Bug reports and requests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please check the forum (discussion) page from right menu of this page. You can get support from the forum or discord server.</p>",
